The [[Box of Prosperity]] is a [[Bag]] normally obtainable by catalytically "opening" the [[Box of Riches]] using a [[Maneki-neko]], [[Hammer]], or [[Thor's Hammer]]. If crafted with either hammer, the hammer will not be consumed. After crafting, without any other Box of Riches present the player will lose the ability to buy [[gemstone|gemstones]] in the shop, as granted by the [[Box of Prosperity]], but they can still gain a chipped gemstone every round as long as there are two or more Godly or Unique items inside the four tiles of the [[Box of Prosperity]].
